      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Thoth también era dios de la luna. A menudo lleva la luna sobre la cabeza.",
          "en": "Thoth was also a god of the moon. He is often shown wearing the moon on his head."
        },
        {
          "es": "Plutarco cuenta que jugó a un juego de mesa con la luna y le ganó cinco días de luz.",
          "en": "Plutarch tells that he played a board game with the moon and won five days of her light."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con esos días extra, el año quedó en 365 días.",
          "en": "With those extra days, the year came to 365 days."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso Thoth era el señor del tiempo: contaba los meses, los años y los reinados.",
          "en": "That is why Thoth was lord of time. He counted the months, the years, and the reigns of kings."
        }
